    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nA stunning A-rated home overlooking Ardmore!Built in 2024 - On a pedestal overlooking Ardmore and the surrounding countryside the property has a most private location well set back from the road below by a winding entrance drive.Standing on 1.19 acres approx. the property is surrounded by beautiful landscaped gardens and patio.Inside, the property is very spacious and bright with a fantastic layout and pristine modern interior. The open plan kitchen/dining/living room is the heart of the house and has designer units with feature lighting and an impressive island unit. This room has windows to all sides as well as a sliding glass door that opens directly to the large patio area. To the front of the ground floor there is a cosy lounge with a picture window to take in the views.Off the impressive entrance hall, a door leads to a bright hallway which accesses all bedrooms. The master is to the end of the hall and to the rear with an adjoining spacious walk-in-wardrobe. The second and third bedrooms are to the front and are both fine size rooms. The main bathroom is exquisitely finished and has both shower and standalone bath tub.Externally, the property has a sandstone gravel drive that continues on to a large steel tech shed at the rear. The patios are extensive and are bordered by landscaped and planted beds. The rear lawn is enormous with elevated views!This is a unique opportunity to purchase a 2024 build A-rated home with sea views!"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "<ul><li>A-rated - built in 2024 - underfloor heating.</li><li>Stunning views over Ardmore Bay and surrounding countryside. </li><li>Large private elevated site - 1.19 acres approx.</li><li>Easy access to N25- 15 mins to Dungarvan and Youghal.</li><li>High spec interior finish with amazing designer kitchen.</li><li>Large utility room with shower room. </li><li>Feature walk-in-wardrobe off master.</li><li>Impressive main bathroom with stylish tile scheme.</li><li>Extensive rear and side patio.</li><li>Decking area at rear of garden.</li><li>Large steel tech garden shed.</li><li>Air-to-water heating.</li><li>Well and septic tank.</ul>"
      },
